Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.27,0:23:38.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那意味着你要对家人负责
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.27,0:23:38.71,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It means you are accountable for other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.71,0:23:42.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你要为他们的生命负责
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.71,0:23:42.31,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You are responsible for their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.31,0:23:45.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}从某个角度来讲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.31,0:23:45.43,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Now, past a certain point,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.59,0:23:48.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这些责任里有一些毫无意义的事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.59,0:23:48.93,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}there's a futility in responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.18,0:24:08.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你就这么点担心吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.18,0:24:08.93,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That's the extent of your concern?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.95,0:24:11.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.95,0:24:11.02,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.02,0:24:14.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我只是不觉得一直看下去能有什么意义
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.02,0:24:14.66,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I just don't know what looking at it any more is gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.39,0:24:17.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我担心的是她
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.39,0:24:17.98,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It's her. I'm concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.83,0:24:21.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}她只是想得到关注
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.83,0:24:21.22,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, she's just trying to get attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.22,0:24:22.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}其他女孩...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.22,0:24:22.87,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and the other girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.00,0:24:26.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}上帝 她们也太早熟了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.00,0:24:26.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Jesus, how do they even know about that stuff yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.80,0:24:28.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}女孩子比男孩子更早懂这些事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.80,0:24:28.95,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Girls always know before boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.70,0:24:30.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.70,0:24:30.69,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.94,0:24:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}因为必须这样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.94,0:24:32.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Because they have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.62,0:24:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}听着 她很不合群
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.62,0:24:36.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Listen to me. She's withdrawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.21,0:24:38.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}她打听过你的事 想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.21,0:24:38.55,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}She asks about you, and she wants to know
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.55,0:24:40.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}为什么你现在工作这么忙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.55,0:24:40.35,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}why you're working so much now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.95,0:24:44.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我很快就没这么忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.95,0:24:44.10,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, I should be working less.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.17,0:24:46.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}特别小组会接手那个案子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.17,0:24:46.37,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Task force is gonna take that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.80,0:24:50.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我也会多待在家里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.80,0:24:50.09,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and I'll be around more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.41,0:24:54.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}上周?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.41,0:24:54.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Last week?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.58,0:24:59.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我很抱歉 我应该推掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.58,0:24:59.99,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'm sorry about that. I should've begged off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.99,0:25:01.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们那天晚上过的不错
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.99,0:25:01.69,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We were having a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.37,0:25:06.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}别打断我 说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.37,0:25:06.14,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Don't stop me. Talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.02,0:25:11.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我快撑不住了 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.02,0:25:11.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'm close, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.02,0:25:14.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你听到了吗? 我快撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.02,0:25:14.82,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Do you hear me? I'm close.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.82,0:25:18.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他们会把案子从我们手里接走的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.82,0:25:18.57,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Um, they're gonna pull that case from us,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.57,0:25:23.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我会多陪陪你们的 我们可以做很多事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.57,0:25:23.49,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and I'll be around more, and we'll do things.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.90,0:25:26.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们之间为什么有这么多隔阂 马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.90,0:25:26.21,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why is there all this space between us, Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.63,0:25:29.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我不懂你的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.63,0:25:29.10,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I don't know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.29,0:25:30.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.29,0:25:30.01,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You do know what I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.01,0:25:32.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但你就是不说 问题就在于此
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.01,0:25:32.29,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and you won't say, and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.09,0:25:34.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那就是我说的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.09,0:25:34.73,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.42,0:25:37.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}去年 你表现的像个阴沉的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.42,0:25:37.39,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}This last year, you've been a sulky teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.39,0:25:38.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.39,0:25:38.74,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.89,0:25:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我想当你的朋友 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.89,0:25:41.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'm trying to be your friend, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.42,0:25:51.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我只是不善于... 表达...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.42,0:25:51.43,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'm just not good at... you know... expressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.46,0:25:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们都会改变的 不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.46,0:25:52.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We change, don't we,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.76,0:25:55.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}虽然有时不会变太久
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.76,0:25:55.42,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and sometimes not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.48,0:25:59.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}而我认为人根本不会变
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.48,0:25:59.37,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And here I'm thinking people don't really change at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.16,0:26:01.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}内心深处永远是同一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.16,0:26:01.54,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}not who they are at heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.38,0:26:03.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我一直试着回忆过去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.38,0:26:03.47,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I try to remember things
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.47,0:26:04.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}因为我觉得自己必须这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.47,0:26:04.58,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}because I feel like I should,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.58,0:26:06.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就好像这是我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.58,0:26:06.34,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}like it's my job or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.31,0:26:09.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}回忆过去的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.31,0:26:09.33,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}you know, early days,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.17,0:26:13.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}而我已经厌倦了回忆过去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.17,0:26:13.37,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and I'm tired of trying to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.67,0:26:14.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}部分原因是...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.67,0:26:14.39,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Part of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.39,0:26:20.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我并不是在否认这全是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.39,0:26:20.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and I'm not talking about the part that's all my fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.40,0:26:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但部分原因在于 这就是生活
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.40,0:26:24.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but part of it, it's just life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.65,0:26:29.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们以前经常整个周末都待在房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.65,0:26:29.02,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We used to spend weekends without leaving my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.02,0:26:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}- 我指的不是这个 - 记的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.02,0:26:30.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}- That's not what I mean. - Remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.12,0:26:32.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们当然不再像十九岁时那样夜夜欢歌
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.12,0:26:32.97,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Of course we don't screw like we're 19.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.98,0:26:37.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}天 你的期望真低
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.98,0:26:37.35,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}God, you want low expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.75,0:26:39.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你根本不思进取
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.75,0:26:39.35,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You put a ceiling on your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.35,0:26:42.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}任何事都是 因为你不想改变
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.35,0:26:42.15,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}on everything, because you won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.48,0:26:48.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我刚认识你时 你比现在聪明多了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.48,0:26:48.11,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You were so much smarter when I met you, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.50,0:26:55.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我很抱歉 玛姬
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.50,0:26:55.53,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'm sorry, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.89,0:26:59.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}所有的一切我都很抱歉...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.89,0:26:59.02,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'm sorry for everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.42,0:27:02.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}因为没有陪在你们身边
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.42,0:27:02.62,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}for not being here,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.62,0:27:06.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}认为一切都理所应当
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.62,0:27:06.69,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}for taking all this for granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.77,0:27:12.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你一直都在干什么 马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.77,0:27:12.15,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}What have you been doing, Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.50,0:27:16.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.50,0:27:16.37,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.24,0:27:25.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}工作 家庭 办案
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.24,0:27:25.65,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}work, home, cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.26,0:27:28.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.26,0:27:28.11,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.98,0:27:33.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我的感觉就像...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.98,0:27:33.57,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I get to feeling like...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.77,0:27:38.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我想着四十岁时的样子...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.77,0:27:38.07,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Look. I can see 40...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.33,0:27:46.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}感觉自己就像动画片中的大野狼
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.33,0:27:46.18,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and it's like I'm that coyote in the cartoons,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.85,0:27:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}跑过了悬崖
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.85,0:27:48.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}like I'm running off a cliff,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.84,0:27:53.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}如果我不往下看继续跑的话
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.84,0:27:53.79,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and if I don't look down and keep running,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.93,0:27:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}可能就没事 但如果
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.93,0:27:57.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I might be fine, but, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.79,0:28:04.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}看来我把一切都搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.79,0:28:04.57,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I think I'm all fucked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.17,0:28:10.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}确实如此
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.17,0:28:10.03,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.35,0:28:13.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}没错 你搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.35,0:28:13.49,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yes. You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.55,0:29:28.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.55,0:29:28.45,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.01,0:29:38.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}话说回来 我们抓了几个医院的病人...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.01,0:29:38.53,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Anyway, well, we pulled a few hospital patients...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.53,0:29:42.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}高个子 脸上有疤 性侵犯者
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.53,0:29:42.67,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}tall, scarred, sex offenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.67,0:29:44.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}有个孩子是非法侵入的惯犯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.67,0:29:44.86,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}One kid did B&Es.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.86,0:29:49.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}每一次犯事都要顺点东西走才行
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.86,0:29:49.55,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He had to tug one out before he could leave a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.74,0:29:54.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}当时在审讯室可待了不少时间
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.74,0:29:54.19,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah. A lot of room work then.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.90,0:29:59.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你们谁比较擅长审讯?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.90,0:29:59.01,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Which one of you guys is the box man?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.91,0:30:02.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是你 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.91,0:30:02.66,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.02,0:30:06.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我以前审讯的本事也不差
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.02,0:30:06.59,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I used to be pretty good in there myself,
