Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.62,0:52:26.83,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}R&I just came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.83,0:52:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}雷金 勒杜8个月前逃离了假释
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.83,0:52:29.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Reggie Ledoux skipped parole 8 months ago.
