Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.89,0:52:31.77,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He's got a stat. Rape complaint,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.77,0:52:35.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}后来被撤诉 但是93年再次被捕
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.77,0:52:35.05,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}charges dropped, but '93, he's busted
