Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.15,0:52:41.83,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}which Dora Lange and Rianne were full of.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.83,0:52:43.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}继续
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.83,0:52:43.18,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Right.
