Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.26,0:52:45.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Ledoux did two years at Avoyelles,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.12,0:52:48.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}猜猜他最后四个月的室友是谁
