Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.38,0:52:52.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这回我必须承认你说对了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.38,0:52:52.21,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I got to give you this one.
