Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.37,0:53:41.35,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.59,0:53:46.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们找到了雷金纳德 勒杜
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.59,0:53:46.45,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}we arrive at Reginald Ledoux.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.41,0:53:52.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}快点 伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.41,0:53:52.09,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Come on, man.
