Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.01,0:53:58.05,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You ever been in a gunfight?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.53,0:54:00.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.53,0:54:00.55,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.70,0:54:02.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那你们又他妈怎么理解
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.70,0:54:02.95,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, then how the fuck you gonna know
