Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.95,0:54:04.42,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}what I'm talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.40,0:54:11.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那地方... 我从来...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.40,0:54:11.47,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Man, that place... I never...
