Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.00,0:54:16.49,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That day, it reminded me of my pop talking about 'Nam
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.88,0:54:19.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}和丛林战
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.88,0:54:19.71,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and the jungle thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.41,0:54:24.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我现在跟你们说当时发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.41,0:54:24.66,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Look. Me talking about what happened back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.75,0:54:27.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}对你们也没什么帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.75,0:54:27.33,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}that ain't gonna do you any good now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.71,0:54:31.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这个...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.71,0:54:31.87,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}This...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.70,0:54:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这个才是我要说的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.70,0:54:35.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}This is what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.27,0:54:38.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我每次说到时间
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.27,0:54:38.77,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}This is what I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.77,0:54:42.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}死亡 和无效尝试时
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.77,0:54:42.87,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}when I'm talking about time and death
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.12,0:54:44.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我指的就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.12,0:54:44.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and futility.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.95,0:54:48.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}工作时会有更多的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.95,0:54:48.33,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}There are broader ideas at work,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.33,0:54:51.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这些想法来自于 人类整体作为一个社会
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.33,0:54:51.23,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}mainly what is owed between us as a society
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.23,0:54:53.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}所持有的相同的错觉
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.23,0:54:53.29,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}for our mutual illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.29,0:54:56.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}盯着尸体看上十四个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.29,0:54:56.33,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}14 straight hours of staring at DBs,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.33,0:54:59.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你就会想到这些事情
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.33,0:54:59.50,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}these are the things you think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.99,0:55:04.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你做过吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.99,0:55:04.61,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You ever done that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.98,0:55:09.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你注视着他们的眼睛 即使只是照片
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.98,0:55:09.09,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You look in their eyes, even in a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.10,0:55:11.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他们是死是活都无关紧要
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.10,0:55:11.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Doesn't matter if they're dead or alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.16,0:55:14.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你都能读出你要的信息 知道你会看出什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.16,0:55:14.57,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You can still read them, and you know what you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.81,0:55:18.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你会看出他们也乐意你这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.81,0:55:18.45,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}They welcomed it,
