Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.14,0:55:23.38,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}mm-hmm, not at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.32,0:55:26.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但是到了最后一刻总会如此
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.32,0:55:26.38,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but right there in the last instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.38,0:55:30.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}很明显这是一种解脱 因为他们原先会害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.38,0:55:30.99,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It's an unmistakable relief, see, because they were afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.99,0:55:33.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}然后他们会第一次发现
